usage: root_qualify_gradient_adam_distributions.py [-h] [--repo REPO]
                                                   --gradient-build
                                                   GRADIENT_BUILD
                                                   --adam-distribution-build
                                                   ADAM_DISTRIBUTION_BUILD
                                                   --stack-build STACK_BUILD
                                                   --output OUTPUT
                                                   [--producer-review PRODUCER_REVIEW]

Execute and bind the frozen candidate05 integration qualification. This is
integration orchestration, not a new independent implementation or semantic
review. It executes the frozen producer and independent runners without
rewriting their expectations. --producer-review explicitly reuses an existing
17-step execution receipt after checking every child and its native inputs. No
installed Torch, NumPy, HIA authoring parser, or numerical runtime is
imported.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --gradient-build GRADIENT_BUILD
  --adam-distribution-build ADAM_DISTRIBUTION_BUILD
  --stack-build STACK_BUILD
  --output OUTPUT
  --producer-review PRODUCER_REVIEW
                        Reuse an existing completed 17-step execution; verify
                        all original children and native files.
